  "releaseNotes": "Features Added\n\t\t- Added adaptive fail-open circuit breaker for improved cluster resilience. Automatically routes around unhealthy nodes with configurable health checks and recovery. Can be opted out by setting RouteManagerEnabled as false.\n\t\t- Added support for AWSConfigs.InitializeCollections: empty response collections are now initialized as empty lists instead of null when enabled, aligning with AWS SDK for .NET V4 behavior.\n\t\t\n\t\tBugs Fixed\n\t\t- Fixed potential socket leak when connection initialization fails.\n\t\t- Fixed health check loop duplication under concurrent failures.\n\t\t\n\t\tOther Changes\n\t\t- Improved async request timeout enforcement for read and write paths.\n\t\t- Improved connection lifecycle management and resource cleanup.",
